        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, concrete demolition, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, concrete demolition, at plant
This is a multi output process of concrete demolition entering the recycling plant. An economic allocation is applied between the disposal service of concrete demolition and the recycling product RC-C and recycled iron.;
UUID: 65c974c1-375c-4844-81a8-8c442c9ddddd
Includes the infrastructure, energy demand and waste of the recycling process of concrete demolition
Location: Data from Eberhard AG, Switzerland
Technology: dry processing, stationary crusher
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_65c974c1-375c-4844-81a8-8c442c9ddddd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
